  "job_B17.9_20251003_114414": {
    "chunk_text": "& \u00c6dred feng to Nor\u00f0hymbra rice. Her \u00c6dred cyning for\u00f0ferde.& feng Eadwig to rice Eadmundes sunu. Her for\u00f0ferde Wulstan arcebiscop. Her Eadwig cyning for\u00f0ferde.& feng Eadgar his bro\u00f0or to rice. On his dagum hit godode georne; & God him geu\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t he wunode on sibbe, \u00fea hwile \u00fee he He arerde Godes lof wide, & Godes lage lufode, & folces fri\u00f0 bette, swi\u00f0ost \u00feara cyninga, \u00fee \u00e6r him & God him eac fylste, \u00fe\u00e6t ciningas & eorlas georne him to bugon, & wurden under\u00feeodde to \u00feam He wear\u00f0 wide, geond \u00feeodland, swi\u00f0e geweor\u00f0ad, for\u00feam \u00fee he weor\u00f0ode Godes naman georne, Ane misd\u00e6da he dyde \u00feeah to swi\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6l\u00feeodige unsida lufode & h\u00e6\u00f0ene \u00feeawas innan Ac God him geunne, \u00fe\u00e6t his gode d\u00e6da swy\u00f0ran wear\u00f0an \u00feonne misd\u00e6da; his sawle to Her fram Eadgar cyning to \u00f0e biscopdome on Wintanceastra wes gecoren Sancte A\u00f0elwold.& \u00fee On \u00fees o\u00f0er gear sy\u00fe\u00feon he w\u00e6s gehalgod.\u00fea makode he feola minstra.& draf ut \u00fea clerca of \u00fee He macode \u00fe\u00e6r twa abbotrice.an of muneca o\u00f0er of nunna.\u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s eall wi\u00f0innan Wintanceastra. Sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fea com he to se cyng Eadgar, bed him \u00feet he scolde him giuen ealle \u00fea minstre \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0ene And se biscop com \u00fea fyrst to Elig.",
